    "reason": "The change text and the release-management document [ev-a93d8c7284ca] describe the end of upstream patch support for Kyverno's own release lines (1.18 and earlier, including 1.13). They do not describe a dependency on, or interaction with, another product. The product-relationship family is for the OTHER product's id, so a product-relationship with name=kyverno makes Kyverno depend on itself and breaks the rule that the product never goes in an identity field. No subject family in the vocabulary fits the product's own support lifecycle (P2 and P3 reached the same conclusion), so no corrected typed assertion follows from the evidence; the rendered-diff evidence covers unrelated CRD and Service changes.",
